  "description": "Workflows for keeping GM.FileStorage files in your database: deleting the bytes queued in the GMStorageCleanup queue (claim, delete, retry with backoff), purging files for good, purging files deleted long ago, checking stored bytes against the catalog (size, SHA-256, decryption, a malware rescan), and per-tenant queries. Works over your app's GMStoredFile / GMStorageCleanup aggregates and GM.EntityFramework repositories; you schedule the batches. Part of the GM.FileStorage family.",
